# Credential files that must never enter git history — git history is permanent, so a single
# careless `git add .` is unrecoverable without rewriting history. Three of these were found
# loose in the working root on 2026-08-16 and moved to ~/.secrets/veervrat/; this is the
# second line of defence, not the first.
client_secret*.json
*-credentials.json
*.pem
*.p12

